<.page_title
  title="Install to first finding in five minutes"
  subtitle="Install ControlKeel, attach an agent host, and reach your first finding."
/>

<div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <.section_title>Install</.section_title>
    <%= for channel <- @install_channels do %>
      <div class="space-y-2" id={"install-channel-#{channel.id}"}>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <.card_title>{channel.label}</.card_title>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-muted px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
            {Enum.join(channel.platforms, ", ")}
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">{channel.description}</p>
        <div class="relative">
          <pre class="whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 px-4 py-3 pr-12 text-sm leading-6 text-foreground"><code>{channel.command}</code></pre>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-copy-command={channel.command}
            class="absolute right-2 top-2 rounded-lg p-1.5 text-muted-foreground transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary"
            aria-label={"Copy #{channel.label} install command"}
            title="Copy command"
          >
            <span data-copy-icon="idle"><.icon name="hero-clipboard-document" class="size-4" /></span>
            <span data-copy-icon="done" class="hidden"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4" /></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-6">
    <.section_title>After install</.section_title>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <.card_title>Bind your project</.card_title>
        <span class="rounded-full bg-muted px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
          once per project
        </span>
      </div>
      <ol class="space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground list-decimal ml-5">
        <li>
          In your project, run
          <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel setup</code>
          to bind it and see detected hosts and recommended attach paths.
        </li>
        <li>
          Run
          <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel attach opencode</code>
          to wire the agent host. Other hosts follow the same command shape.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
        Binding auto-bootstraps on first use. If it didn't fire,
        <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel bootstrap</code>
        or
        <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel init</code>
        does it explicitly — both are idempotent and safe to re-run.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <.card_title>Verify and inspect</.card_title>
        <span class="rounded-full bg-muted px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
          anytime
        </span>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground list-disc ml-5">
        <li>
          <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel</code>
          boots the local web app.
        </li>
        <li>
          <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel attach doctor</code>
          and
          <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel provider doctor</code>
          check host wiring and provider health.
        </li>
        <li>
          <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel status</code>
          shows the binding and session snapshot.
        </li>
        <li>
          Trigger a controlled validation, then check Session Control or run
          <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground">controlkeel findings</code>
          to see your first finding.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
      Attach defaults to project scope and writes inside the governed repository. User scope is available only for hosts that advertise it. Local stdio MCP exposes the full local tool set; hosted MCP is a separate, narrower OAuth-scoped surface.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
